# Allowlist for `mypy.stubtest`, read by scripts/run-all-checks.sh and CI.
#
# The only supported import is "from pdsparser import ...", so __init__.pyi is the only
# stub and describes the whole public API. The private modules (_PDS3_GRAMMAR,
# _fast_dict, _utils) carry no stub and are kept out of stubtest's discovery by
# [tool.mypy] exclude in pyproject.toml, so nothing needs to be accepted here. Add an
# entry only for a deliberate, documented mismatch between the stub and the runtime.
